Family baseline (lens counts labeled): T15 a1 78.5 (4-lens) FAIL — motion 68, reuse 64 convergent on surplus freeze · T15 a2 80.0 (5-lens) FAIL — reuse floor 58 · T15 a3 85.2 (5-lens) PASS — motion floor 76 after reuse cured · T45 a1 88.2 (5-lens) PASS — reuse floor 78. Five-lens family mean = (400+426+441)/15 = **84.47** (plan-review arithmetic, adopted). Named failure classes priced: convergent freeze — impossible by construction (reserve + surplus always streaming, jitter never zero, velocity continuity incl. lock/release) · intensity collapse — borrow-flag opacities + swap-invariant assertion · phrase overlap — single-subject phase machine · fitting limits — one logical canvas (960×540), fit rule binds width AND height; at 360 px phone width the numeral spans ≈134 logical cells across (0.70×960÷5), legibility re-checked in swap at phone size · render-proof limitation — no browser binary in this seat: logic-harness checks + PIXEL-UNVERIFIED printed on the attempt (lane standing limitation).
